              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love it! I added Mangos (used less pineapple), Cinnamon, and Vanilla. I didn't have any Rum so I substituted Whiskey lol - It is very yummy - the top crusts up with sweet slightly caramelized goodness!",
