              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "laurie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty and easy to make. I think its very important not to completely change a receipe and wonder why it doest work! try it as written, and then decide if you want to make modifications.\nI did this early for a pre trial for Christmas, and will be making it again for the Holidays.\nThanks for a different take of fruit cake!",
